{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "chatcmpl-tool-8ac58f5cee6183c1", "type": "tool_result", "content": "=== arxiv (5 results) ===\n  1. Modeling Stylistic Co-evolution in Symbolic Music Heritage Collections\n     https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.23957\n     [authors=Yulong He, Ivan Smirnov, Yanming Li | published=2026-07-27 | primary_category=cs.SD | id=2607.23957]\n  2. Diffusion-based Symbolic Music Generation with Structured State Space Models\n     https://arxiv.org/abs/2507.20128\n     [authors=Shenghua Yuan, Xing Tang, Jiatao Chen, Tianming Xie, Jing Wang, Bing Shi | published=2025-07-27 | primary_category=cs.SD | id=2507.20128]\n  3. Symbolic Music Representations for Classification Tasks: A Systematic Evaluation\n     https://arxiv.org/abs/2309.02567\n     [authors=Huan Zhang, Emmanouil Karystinaios, Simon Dixon, Gerhard Widmer, Carlos Eduardo Cancino-Chacón | published=2023-09-05 | primary_category=eess.AS | id=2309.02567]\n  4. musif: a Python package for symbolic music feature extraction\n     https://arxiv.org/abs/2307.01120\n     [authors=Ana Llorens, Federico Simonetta, Martín Serrano, Álvaro Torrente | published=2023-07-03 | primary_category=cs.SD | id=2307.01120]\n  5. AI-based experts' knowledge visualization of cultural heritage: A case study of Terracotta Warriors\n     https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.22480\n     [authors=Siyi Li, Yue Jiang, Bowen Jing, Liuyuxin Yang, Yuhe Zhang | published=2026-04-24 | primary_category=cs.HC | id=2604.22480]\n\n=== openalex (5 results) ===\n  1. The Political Unconscious: Narrative as a Socially Symbolic Act\n     https://openalex.org/W2080943250\n     [rank=1 | id=W2080943250]\n  2. The Political Unconscious: Narrative as Socially Symbolic Act\n     https://openalex.org/W2494911007\n     [rank=2 | id=W2494911007]\n  3. The Transformation of Traditional Dance from Its First to Its Second Existence: The Effectiveness of Music - Movement Education and Creative Dance in the Preservation of